window.products.push({"id":411029,"name":"DYNAMIC SE 2 Pack Hat Washer for Washing Machine, Baseball Caps Cleaner Fits for Adult/Kid's Hat Frame for Dishwasher (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GexZEFZaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【New Design】We've got a new design that makes the structure more stable. Double-hook latch and PE plastic frame will not break during cleaning. 【Hat Cleaner Protector】This cap washer gives your hat a new look after washing. So we provide you with the perfect solution to give your old hats a new life. 【Size Fit All】It works on most adult’s and kid’s hats. It is suitable for baseball caps, golf caps, curved caps, Flat Brim caps and so on 【Easy Use】Put the hat cage in the dishwasher or washing machine. For safer hat wash, please use the top rack of your dishwasher and avoid using a front-load type washing machine. 【Multi-use】Not only is this hat rack great for cleaning dirty hats, it's also a great hat organizer to keep them in shape, whether at home or in a suitcase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GexZEFZaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DYNAMIC SE","source_asin":"B0B211FT1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411029","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B211FT1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B211FT1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
