window.products.push({"id":411072,"name":"Happy 4th of July Decorations-Vintage Independence Day Banner Bunting America Patriotic Hanging Banner Sign Garland for Celebration Party Mantel Firep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q0MP32YnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【What You Will Get】This package of Independence Day decorations contains 10 vintage flag cards with different patterns, a pink thin ribbon, a plastic poking pin, which can be made into 2Pcs Patriotic Day hanging banners. 【Good Quality and Size】4th of July banner sign measures 5.5X7inch/14X18cm, it is made of paper material, and the rope is long enough to hang in multiple places. Stand out at your Independence Day party. 【Unique Design】10 retro patterns with different elements, with strong and bright colors, which can be decorated on walls, porches, garden fences, fireplaces, and increase the festive atmosphere. 【Applicable】American patriotic flag hanging sign can be used to decorate patriotic festivals such as July 4th Independence Day, Patriotic Day Party, National Day and so on. Perfect for hanging in the living room, front door, window, tree branch, or as a gift to enhance your relationship. 【Buy with confidence】One-of-a-kind products are only designed for important festivals. If you have any questions about us, welcome to contact us through the platform email.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q0MP32YnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GREHUMOR","source_asin":"B09YYGVPK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YYGVPK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YYGVPK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":411073,"name":"Hinterland Trading Air Plant Ionantha Ionantha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eEfJBiWYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Air Plants (Tillandsia) get their common name from the fact they don’t require soil. They are epiphytes, which attach to other plants or trees for support. Their roots are only used to anchor themselves and are normally removed during cultivation for aesthetics. They are not parasitic, instead they gather micro nutrients from the air and water in structures called trichomes on their leaves. As the plant dries the trichomes take on a white powder look. After watering the plant will return to a vibrant green. Air Plants must dry fully between watering because they are susceptible to rot if left wet to long. These Air Plants will only bloom once, but after the bloom they can form up to 12 “Pups”, or offspring, at their base. The main plant will slowly be on its way out, but the Pups will continue to thrive and will separate when mature. Air Plants prefer filtered sunlight as their natural home is under tree canopy. This makes them perfect house plants. Air Plant care is pretty simple. Upon arrival give your plants a good hour or two soak in a shallow bowl of water. Place the plants root/base side up and out of the water. The base is the area susceptible to rot if left wet too long. You can mist the plants a few times a week or repeat the soaking once a week or a combination of the two. Just remember the best thing you can do for your plant is to let it dry completely between watering. Air Plants like as much filtered sunlight as they can get. Anywhere within 8 feet of a window that gets light for the better part of the day will work. If that’s not possible they can live on artificial light, but the source has to be pretty close like a desk lamp. As a special treat you can collect rainwater for your Air Plant, the nutrients in rainwater or pond water are more abundant than in the air or tap water, but this is not necessary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eEfJBiWYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hinterland Trading","source_asin":"B006UF9MV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411073","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006UF9MV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006UF9MV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
