window.products.push({"id":411160,"name":"I & Candle, Lavender Aromatherapy ECO Soy Candle. Made in The USA with Pure Essential Oils Blend and All Natural Ingredients. 10.5 oz.(297g)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jHSn9URlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural Clean Burning Wax: WARNING! To prevent fire and serious injury: Burn candle within sight. Keep away from drafts and vibrations. Keep out of reach of children and pets. Never burn candle on or near anything that can catch fire. BURNING INSTRUCTIONS: When lit, allow the candle to burn for at least 2 hours or until a \"wax pool\" forms and covers the entire top surface of the candle. This allows the wax to burn evenly and extends the burn time and optimizes the candle's scent. For best results, we recommend burning the candle in 2 ~ 3 hour intervals. This wick may need to be trimmed. Trim the wick to ¼ inch before lighting. Wick maintenance is crucial to candle care. During longer burns, the wick will begin to form a \"mushroom\" like shape, care should be taken to remove these burned remnants and re-trim the wick to 1/4 inch after each burn. Allowing your candle to burn as it \"mushrooms\", will negatively impact the candles scent. Keep candle free of any foreign materials including matches and wick trimmings. Only burn the candle on a level, fire resistant surface. Do not burn the candle for more than 4 hours at a time. A single candle is perfect for a small to medium size room (e.g., bedroom, bathroom). Larger spaces will require 2 or more candles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jHSn9URlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"I & Candle","source_asin":"B06XW3GWHM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XW3GWHM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XW3GWHM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
