window.products.push({"id":411203,"name":"Camping Fan with LED Light - Battery Operated Fan Rechargeable Tent Personal Mini Fan with Hanging Hook, Portable Clip On Fan, Ceiling Fan for Travel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eIKFgJzAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Camping Fan with LED Light 【Powerful and Super Quiet Airflow】—— This 3-speed adjustable clip fan is built in upgraded brushless motor, which delivers powerful airflow but also makes the fan surprisingly quiet. The wind distance up to 2m, the maximum working decibel is just 40db, it will not disturb you at all when you are working or sleeping. The fan can be placed on a tabletop with its clip or used directing airflow where you need it with light when you are camping. 【Customize Your Comfort】——With 3-speed option and 360 °Rotation fan head, you’ll always feel comfortable and cool. You can adjust appropriate fan speed (Low-Mid-High) by pressing the button, the low speed is suitable for your quiet office or reading; the maximum speed is up to 2.8 m/s. Perfect fan for your room. 【Strong clip and Led light】——Easily clip onto any surface, even running upside down or be adjusted to point in any direction. The fan with clip, which can be fixed on objective of thickness within 2.5 inches. Moreover, the soft rubber on clip will never cause any scratch. This portable fan will supply you with 3-level light. Choose what you need. The bright Led light on fan makes you more convenient when used during the night or outdoors. 【Easy Operation &Super Durable Fan】—— Decovolt Portable Mini Desk Fan is powered by 7000mAH rechargeable lithium battery. It will work 6-16 hours depending on fan speed after fully charging. It can be recharged by computer, laptop, power bank, car charger etc. Press the fan power button to change the speed(low-medium-high-off) and press the light power button to change the light level (bright-medium-low-off). If fully charged, the micro fast charging indicator light will turn from red to green. 【360 Degree Rotation & 12-Month Warranty】——Decovolt Mini Desk Fan can be adjusted 360° on vertical and horizontal directions, It can be stably fixed in the position you want, bringing you coolness and comfort from any angle. Customer satisfaction is what we care about most. We provide worry-free 12-month warranty and friendly customer service. If you have any dissatisfaction with our products, please feel free to contact us, we will solve the problem for you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eIKFgJzAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decovolt","source_asin":"B0B17BNF9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B17BNF9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B17BNF9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
