window.products.push({"id":411305,"name":"Seneca River Trading Food Processor Tritan Work Bowl Cover fits Cuisinart DLC-10, DLC-117BGTXT1, DLC-117BGTXT-1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NwOx72ZrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brand new Tritan food processor work bowl cover, DLC-117BGTXT-1. Fits Cuisinart DLC-10 series. This cover features 4 tabs on the bottom rim. This cover will only work with a Tritan workbowl. If you do not have a Tritan workbowl and your bowl only features the 2 tabs you will also need to replace the workbowl with part number FP-631AGTXT-1 as the 2 tabbed DLC-117BGTX-1 cover is no longer available. If you are not sure if you have a Tritan model, please feel to contact us and we will be happy to help!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NwOx72ZrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seneca River Trading","source_asin":"B097C88DTK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097C88DTK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097C88DTK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":411306,"name":"Instant Read Meat Thermometer for Cooking, BBQGO 3 in 1 Waterproof Digital Food Thermometer BG-HH2P with 2 Detachable Wired Probe, Backlight, and Alar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qDW3cgL9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Foldable Probe & 2 Detachable Long Probes: The food thermometer supports max 3 probes at a time, monitors 3 kinds of food simultaneously. The 59” long stainless steel mesh cables are heat resistant, allow users to safely measure the temp of food in the oven while cooking, ideal to use in combination with ovens, smokers and stoves. Ultra Fast & Accurate: Only takes 2 seconds to get a readout, -58°F~572°F(-50℃~300℃) wide measurement range, ±0.5℃/±1.0℉ high accuracy, covers almost all cooking requirements. The LCD screen displays the values clearly even at night with the backlight, reduces the possibility of misreading. IPX5 Waterproof, Supports ℉/℃ switch, calibration, alarm setting, backlight setting, probe setting and screen lock, even the lighting time of the backlight and the volume of the alarm sound can be set according to your needs, what’s more, each probe can be set separately. Auto On/Off: Pull out the foldable probe, then the thermometer will be turned on automatically, fold it back, the thermometer will be shut off. Without an external probe inserted, the thermometer will turn off 3 minutes later if there’s no operation and the temperature stays the same for 3 minutes, it will auto-restart if a sudden temperature change is detected. Besides, you can turn on/off the thermometer by pressing the power button. Convenient Design: Splash proof, you can easily clean the thermometer with a wet cloth when it is covered with dirt; Strong magnetic back and hook, make storage easy, you can hang it somewhere with a nail or just attach it to metal surfaces of the home appliance; Powered by 2 AAA batteries, which can be found in almost everywhere in the world, users will no longer need to worry about the battery model.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qDW3cgL9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BBQGO","source_asin":"B09N38GFVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N38GFVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N38GFVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
