window.products.push({"id":411392,"name":"BETTARY Kids Desk and Chair Set, Height Adjustable Ergonomic Children's School Workstation with Storage Drawer, Bookshelf, Tiltable Desktop for 3-14 B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fzBCpFV8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Description: This interactive kid height adjustable study table and chair set combines safety and fun for children of varying age and size. And our kid's desk and chair set can be your child's ideal learning partner! This learning table height is adjustable with locking rotary knobs to grow with your child. And the desktop can be tilted from 0-50°angle to protect their eyesight. It is equipped with an large pull-out drawer, which can provide ample space for store various stationery. Besides, the chair with winged backrest design can protect child's spine, getting a comfortable sitting feeling. Features: Tiltable desktop provides better angle to meet various activities Anti-pinch design protects fingers from harm Large desktop provides ample room for kids to study or draw comfortably Spacious pull-out drawer under the desktop to store school supplies Raised bookshelf with two storage bucket to hold books, pens to reduce clutter Hydraulic rod to buffer the falling speed of the desktop Ergonomic winged backrest design for protecting child's spine Specifications： Color: Blue/Pink Material: Steel Frame, MDF, PVC Desk Dimension: 31\" x 23.5\" x 31\"-38.5\" (L x W x H) Chair Dimension: 15.5\" x 16.5\" x 26\"-31\" (L x W x H) Bookshelf Dimension: 31\" x 7.5\" x 10\" (L x W x H) Surface Tilt: 0° to 50° Weight Capacity of Desktop: 88 lbs Weight Capacity of Desk: 176 lbs Weight Capacity of Chair: 176 lbs Net Weight: 60 lbs Recommended Age: 3-14 years old Package Includes: 1 x Study Desk & Chair 1 x User’s Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fzBCpFV8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09FT4Q8MB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FT4Q8MB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FT4Q8MB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":411393,"name":"COZCOT White Sheets Set, Twin XL Bed Sheets, Soft 100% Cotton Sheets, Hotel Luxury 3 Pc, 450 Thread Count Sateen Weave, College Dorm Sheets Extra Long","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KZnfVAqpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% COTTON SHEET SET. 100% Cotton Sateen Weave Sheet Set brings the softness and durability to your bed. Surprised by its silky, smooth and soft texture, feels like sleeping on a premium hotel bed. Using high quality selected Long-Staple Cotton yarns, makes it outstanding in Sateen 450 TC sheets. Variable colors available to match your duvet, comforter in White, Navy Blue, Pink, Olive Green, Magic Grey, Red, Khaki. THE BEST FIT FOR TWINXL SIZE MATTRESS: Our fitted sheet’s extra deep pocket fit for adjustable mattresses up to 15 inches deep, and all-around elastic for a secure fit. ‘Head or Foot’ tag was attached on the side for easily making the bed, and one-side open case pillowcase for changing bedding more convenient. The 3-piece twinXL sheet set include 1 Flat Sheet (66’’ W x 100’’ L), 1 Fitted sheet (39” W x 80” L + 15” deep pocket), and 1 Pillowcase (21” W x 30” L) QUALITY CERTIFIED COTTON SHEETS FOR YOUR SAFETY: We source pure organic cotton that is grown naturally without any chemicals or harmful substance. Unlike microfiber and other types of linen, cotton is better for the environment, keeps you warm and cozy, and keeps you comfortable. Moreover, the STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX certification, and GOTS certification ensures that our cotton bed sheets are free from harmful dyes and chemicals, making them safe for you and your family and your kids to use at home. EASY TO CARE: Our top-rated cotton bed sheets are machine washable and don't fade when washed since they are made with the best quality dyes. Additionally, they do not pill or shrink easily. Compared to silk sheets, which require expert maintenance, Sateen sheets are more robust, affordable, and lasting. Give the sheets a few washes to achieve its smoothness as cotton softens with washing. We advise washing it first if you are sensitive skin. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE - Our Sateen sheets are some of the softest Sateen sheets you can find online, they are backed by incredible customer service to make sure your satisfaction is guaranteed. If you don’t like our bed sheets, you can return them for a refund or replacement as per Amazon guidelines, no question asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KZnfVAqpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COZCOT","source_asin":"B09XDGLJ6Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XDGLJ6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XDGLJ6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
