window.products.push({"id":411397,"name":"ICOOL Outdoor Wall Mounting Bracket for 9000-36000 BTU, Over 330 LBS Universal Mini Split Ductless Air Conditioner Heat Pumps, Compressors & HVAC Syst","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gj0HeoYhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Good Compatibility】Compatible with most mini split air conditioners, adjustable for use with up to 9,000 - 36,000 BTU units, like universal mini split, ductless air conditioner, heat pumps, AC compressors & HVAC systems, can withstand weights exceeding 330LBS. 【Heavy Duty Design】Made of high-quality heavy duty steel which is galvanized and epoxy painted, our mini split bracket features one cross bar and two foldable L-shaped brackets. Triangle stiffeners design enhances the structure for long term stability. 【Outstanding Features】Exclusive built-in spirit level helps you correct mounting slope position. Angle regulators mounted on the vertical arms help you adjust the distance between the bracket and the wall. Bolts and anti-vibration pads provided help you optimize the safety and stability of mini split condensing unit installation. Attention: Install concrete anchors into the position of both sides of the crossbeam and into vertical arms to stabilize the bracket and increase load-bearing capacity. 【All Hardware Included】Breezy installation and versatility, assembly is easy enough. All necessary hardware included, please refer to our instructions provided. (If any accessories missing when you receive the wall mount air conditioner bracket, although it is a small probability event, please feel free to contact us at any time. 【Preparation Matters】Please check to ensure clearance requirements are being met for your mini split unit. Keep your mini split elevated, protect from dirt, snow, debris, floods, vandalism, grass-clippings, etc. Great for all climates.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gj0HeoYhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICOOL","source_asin":"B098JMG9Y6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098JMG9Y6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098JMG9Y6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
