window.products.push({"id":411549,"name":"WORX WG545.4 Cordless Hi-Capacity Blower, Battery Included (Renewed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715SnphMF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This pre-owned or refurbished product has been professionally inspected and tested to work and look like new. How a product becomes part of Amazon Renewed, your destination for pre-owned, refurbished products: A customer buys a new product and returns it or trades it in for a newer or different model. That product is inspected and tested to work and look like new by Amazon-qualified suppliers. Then, the product is sold as an Amazon Renewed product on Amazon. If not satisfied with the purchase, renewed products are eligible for replacement or refund under the Amazon Renewed Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715SnphMF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B07X1FYQJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411549","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X1FYQJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X1FYQJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":411550,"name":"Luxury Cutting Boards for Kitchen - Reversible Wood Cutting Board Set, Thick Chopping Board - Wooden Cutting Board Set with Juice Groove - Bamboo Cutt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814iDZCksmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ AMAZING BOARDS FOR ALL KITCHEN TASKS. This wooden cutting board set features three convenient sizes for optimal use in the kitchen or on the go. Use the larger 15” x 10” x 0.6” chopping board for carving savoury meats, the medium 12” x 8” x 0.6” for chopping up salads and cruciferous veggies, and the smaller 9” x 6” x 0.6” cutting boards for slicing fruits or for quick meal prep on the spot. These wood cutting boards are sure to take your cooking to new heights. ✅ BEST KITCHEN CUTTING BOARDS FOR YOUR KNIVES. Our minimally refined wooden chopping boards make for a reliable cutting surface that won’t dull your knives with each use. Known to be easy on the knives you won’t have to face any scarring or marks after each use with this kitchen cutting board set. You can rely on bamboo’s robust structure to meet your chopping board needs for years to come. ✅ MADE FOR EASE OF USE. These bamboo cutting boards for kitchen use, serve great not only as cutting boards but also as cheese charcuterie platters, appetizer trays, snack/grazing boards, and more. Their convenient size makes for ease of mobility so you can transport your masterpieces comfortably to your party, book club, or friendly gathering. ✅ PREMIUM QUALITY. Royal Craft Wood’s bamboo cutting board set is ideal for everyday use thanks to their deep juice grooved edges to catch any meat or fruit liquids as you chop. No matter the chaos that may be happening all around, you can rest assured your workstation will remain clean and organized. ✅ SPARK LASTING MEMORIES. Show your love this holiday season with our chopping board, serving tray, or cheese board set. Our cutting boards for kitchen use are just what you’ve been looking for. Gift a gift that’ll bring the whole family together. Communicate your appreciation with our bamboo cutting board set with juice groove, we guarantee they’ll love it. 💰MONEY-BACK WARRANTY: Our brand is committed to providing our customers the best possible support and satisfaction. That’s why we offer a comprehensive customer support program with a 1-year warranty, a money-back guarantee, and 24/7 customer support. We understand the importance of standing behind our products and ensuring our customers are delighted","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814iDZCksmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROYAL CRAFT WOOD","source_asin":"B0C3P7CCHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411550","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3P7CCHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3P7CCHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
