window.products.push({"id":411608,"name":"Helen Chen's Asian Kitchen 7.5-Inch Stainless Steel Chef Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NlsdBeX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Arguably, a good knife is the essence of Chinese cooking. Helen's Asian Kitchen Classic Chinese Chef Knife is designed slightly smaller and leaner than the traditional Chinese cleaver. The result? A lighter, more agile knife that performs all the same basic functions without the weight and bulky size. Beautifully weighted and balanced, our knife reduces fatigue. And the seamless stainless steel handle washes completely clean and will not absorb any oil, moisture, or juices from meat and seafood. Made from the highest-quality German-standard stainless steel, our Classic Chinese Chef Knife meets the demands of the Asian kitchen with ease and effortless precision. Use and Care: As with any fine cutlery, we do not recommend washing in the dishwasher. Heat and harsh detergents may pit or discolor the steel over time. Wash the knife by hand in hot soapy water. Rinse and dry thoroughly. Store in a knife block or on a magnetic rack. If storing in a drawer, use a blade guard for safety and to prevent damaging or dulling the blade. Lifetime warranty against manufacturer's defects in workmanship. Helen Chen is a leading Asian culinary expert, cookbook author, cooking instructor and developer of Helen's Asian Kitchen cookware and cooking accessories. Helen's focus is making Asian cooking quick and easy, healthy, and more accessible to the home cook. Here recipes are updated to incorporate heart-healthy oils and readily available supermarket ingredients while still maintaining the authentic flavors and variety of traditional Asian cuisine. Her inspiration for new recipes and products comes from her frequent trips to Asia for business and family visits.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NlsdBeX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIC Kitchen","source_asin":"B000UF0L3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000UF0L3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000UF0L3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
