window.products.push({"id":411644,"name":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc. Oversized Micro Fleece Couch Throw Blanket, Warm Throw Blankets for Bed, Thick Blanket, Large Reversible Really Soft Plus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ll9EHqWXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is Included: One high quality oversized throw blanket 50 in wide x 70 in long. It is made with smooth and soft microfleece 280 GSM fabric. It is truly an oversized throw blanket as most throw sized blankets are 50 x 60. We have added 10 extra inches in our throw size blanket so two people can easily share the blanket on a couch. This oversized blanket is extremely versatile. You can use it as a bed throw blanket or simply to layer your bed with other bedding or snuggle with your loved ones as an oversized couch throw blanket on your sofa. It can also be used outdoors. People take them to the parks and picnics, and it also makes a beautiful gift for people of all ages and gender. Create memories with this King Sherpa Blanket and Cal King Sherpa Blanket & snuggle in softness with your family and watch your favorite movies. These extra-large blankets are the softest blankets. Elevate your house with these soft blankets & throws. These Sherpa Blankets are perfect for anyone in your family, whether girls’ room, boys’ room, or the master bedroom, they fit right in. Equally useful for adults, teens, and kids. Premium Quality: Reversible Sherpa Fleece Blanket and throws are made with Highest Quality Of 100% Microfiber Polyester yarn. This means there is no shrinkage or color fading. These blankets and throws retain their shape overtime. These ultra-Plush and soft throw blankets are easier to maintain than cotton blankets. These blankets have Simple yet elegant design can be used in any type of room décor, from farmhouse to shabby chic to modern contemporary room decor. When it comes to quality, these are not cheap blankets at all. These Sherpa and microfleece blankets are easy to fold & store as well. They do not need ironing either.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ll9EHqWXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc.","source_asin":"B0B1RBT8WV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1RBT8WV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1RBT8WV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
