window.products.push({"id":411758,"name":"New York Botanical Garden by Chesapeake Bay Candle 6-Piece Wax Melt, Verbena Basil (2-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811P1yVFPNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The new York botanical garden by Chesapeake Bay Candle 6-piece wax melt 2-pack, includes botanical scents and designs inspired by the grounds, architecture, and rare illustrated works of the new York botanical garden. The Verbena basil fragrance (ocimum basilicum) is inspired by the herb garden. Fresh herbal scents of Verbena, grapefruit, and tomato Leaf deliver a natural, soft aroma as we walk throughout the herb garden. Notes of tarragon, basil, red currant, and rhubarb embrace the invigorating and uplifting atmosphere, resting on a bed of fresh pepper and green Moss. Includes Essential oils of basil, lemon, and clary Sage. Wax melt packaging is adorned with signature new York botanical garden archival illustrations; the electric ceramic warmer (sold separately) is modeled after nybg's iconic Conservatory. The collection celebrates the exceptional beauty and unique artistry of the Garden's rare archival holdings, and shares, through fragrance, the magnificent botanicals found in its diverse, living collections. The new York botanical garden (nybg) is an iconic living museum, a major educational institution, and a scientific organization operating one of the world's largest plant Research and conservation programs. Integral to this initiative are the rare archival collections of the Garden's luesther T. Mertz Library, which contain illustrated works dating back as far as the 12th century. Chesapeake Bay Candle has partnered with the new York botanical garden on a finely fragranced collection to celebrate the exceptional beauty and unique artistry of the Garden's rare archival holdings, and to share with consumers, through fragrance, the magnificent botanicals found in its diverse living collections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811P1yVFPNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chesapeake Bay Candle","source_asin":"B0113YIE2C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0113YIE2C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0113YIE2C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
