window.products.push({"id":411785,"name":"Dekala Kids Alarm Clock (Smart Kids Alrm Clock)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b14eNnddL._AC_SL1458_.jpg","description":"✨Intuitive App OK TO WAKE CLOCK FOR KIDS --Ok to wake clock is designed by American children's designer-Mary. Including 6 cute expressions + 7 night light colors inside this kid alarm clock,+5 levels of light brightness + 10 levels of sound adjustment to ensure that your child's sleep is peaceful. Dekala uses facial expression changes and colors to teach your child what time to go to sleep or to get up. Its 7-color gentle night light and 10 types of soothing sleep music act like a child's friend which could soothe the child to sleep, growing with girls and boys. 😴ALL-IN-ONE SLEEP TRAINING CLOCK FOR TODDLERS--Dekala kid alarm clock is a good clock to teach children time, it has 12/24H time display and 4 alarm clocks: Wake-up alarm, Sleeper alarm, Play alarm and Nap alarm. Each of the four alarm clocks can be selected with toddlers' favorite expression, night light color and soft music. The snooze function of the kids alarm clock for boys girls is also a favorite of children, so let the cute little ones sleep a little longer! 📱EASY TO SET ANYTIME AND ANYWHERE--2022 new upgrade, Dekala kids clock can be controlled remotely by Dekala Home/Smart Life App. You can get more customized settings than manual, just install the App and control it remotely via network. Hence as long as your alarm clock is online, you can change your settings anytime and anywhere, without worrying about disturbing your sleeping children. Such as sound level, music, light/screen brightness, sound effects (10 types) and light effects (5 types), etc. Note: When pairing for the FIRST time, the phone needs to be connected to 2.4G WIFI, and bluetooth, GPS to pair successfully. ✨DAYLIGHT SAVINGS CONTROL--Dekala Ok to wake clock is a kids digital clock, a daylight saving clock, using network to automatically school time, so it can automatically adjust the summer time and you no longer have to worry about children getting up or being late for school! 💕SAFE AND DURABLE--Dekala Kid alarm clock is made of child-safe ABS and silicone, comfortable to the touch, sturdy and durable, certified by FCC-ID, CE, RoHS, UL, etc. With the elegantly designed package, Dekala would deliver you and your kids joy and happiness. LIFETIME WARRANTY--Dekala Kids alarm clock provides lifetime warranty for you. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us and we will get back to you within 24 hours with a reasonable solution. Besides, in order to help you adapt to the smart kids clock faster, you can find detailed product descriptions and teaching videos for each setting in the user manual. Intuitive app easy to set up ，Detailed instruction video for users. Feel free to contact Dekala Store Customer Service when you need further assistance , Please do not contact amazon service only . They may do not know how to use our products very well","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b14eNnddL._AC_SL1458_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dekala","source_asin":"B09ZJ6JKJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZJ6JKJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZJ6JKJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
