window.products.push({"id":411818,"name":"3B Scientific T30039 Cat Skeleton (Felis Catus), Flexibly Mounted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31M03CkYVLL.jpg","description":"The 3B Scientific T30029 cat skeleton model ( Felis catus ) is used for comparative anatomical and mammalogical study, and is flexibly mounted with movable limbs for demonstration of natural feline motion. The model consists of real bones for accurate presentation. The T30029 is mounted on a wood base for display. This model is a natural specimen; actual product appearance, size, etc., may vary from the example shown here. Natural sciences models are typically used as educational aids in medical and scientific classrooms and office settings. Science education products incorporate applied math and science principles into classroom and homeschool-based projects. Teachers in pre-K, elementary, and secondary classrooms use science education kits and products alongside science, technology, engineering, and math (STEM) curriculum to demonstrate STEM concepts and real-world applications through hands-on activities. Science education projects include a broad range of activities, such as practical experiments in engineering, aeronautics, robotics, energy, chemistry, physics, biology, and geology. 3B Scientific manufactures anatomical models, simulators, charts, and other training materials for use in scientific, medical, and patient education. Founded in 1948 and headquartered in Hamburg, Germany, 3B Scientific meets ISO 9001: 2008 standards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31M03CkYVLL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"3B Scientific","source_asin":"B005DTL570","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005DTL570","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005DTL570","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
