window.products.push({"id":411914,"name":"Tbfit Upholstered Wall Mounted Headboard for King Size Bed, Soundproof Peel and Stick Headboards, Tufted Floating Dorm Bed Headboard, Pack of 12 Panel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":144.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WG+xXX5bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Friendly Reminder: This product is suitable for flat, clean and dry walls or surfaces. It should be noted that the wall needs to be wiped before installation to make the glue fit more closely. If you want to stick it on a textured painted wall or diatom mud convex wall, it is recommended to use liquid nails or glass glue for reinforcement. Easy to Assemble: Never worry about damaging the walls again! The Tbfit Peel and Stick headboard is installed with tape with strong viscosity, no need to drill on the wall, the installation can be completed by tearing off the glue surface, which is easier to install than the ordinary anchored headboard. High-density Cushion: The cover of the tufted headboard is made of beautiful and durable natural linen fabric, it will not emit a harmful odor, but we still suggest opening the package and ventilating for 72 hours first to remove the fresh smell. In order to ensure the quality and durability of the headboard, we use 1.4 inch high-density foam as the inner core of the cushion which resilience is also better than that of other panel headboards, and will be with you in life. Stylish DIY: Tbfit upholstered headboard combines simple design with modern materials to create an elegant headboard that is both light and simple and easy to DIY. You can use only one pack of panels to make the headboard or use multiple packs of panels to decorate your walls. Our headboard is great interior decoration, it will be the ideal choice for you to spend quality time with your family. Noise Isolated Panel: The interior of our dorm bed headboard is filled with dense furniture-grade foam, which can effectively suppress sound and reduce environmental noise. The splicing of multiple panels can enhance the noise-proofing effect. It is suitable for all scenes in offices, living rooms, bedrooms, etc. It can be easily integrated into your decoration style, and it will become the focus of business or residence. Service & Guarantee: Each pack includes 12 panels of 10\" x 24\". Because of strong adhesion, you can apply masking tape on the wall first, and then stick the headboards on it after 24 hours, so as not to damage the paint when changing the headboard. If you have any questions about the quality, installation, or parts of the wall panel headboard, please feel free to contact us first.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WG+xXX5bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tbfit","source_asin":"B0B1HCKHXF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1HCKHXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1HCKHXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
