window.products.push({"id":411932,"name":"Wooden Salad Bowl Serving Set - Handcrafted Hardwood Bowl and Salad Fork / Spoon Serving Utensils - 11.5\" Diameter x 6\" Multipurpose for Prepping and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OimBn0CRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CRAFTSMAN QUALITY. A masterful creation of Natural Hardwood, our serving bowl is non-porous and resistant to food and odor absorption. To fit all your needs, the hardwood is food safe and non-toxic, perfect for tossing and prepping salads. Durable and highly resistant to chipping and breaking so you can enjoy years of use. The rustic look adds chic and sophisticated style to any indoor and outdoor table setting LARGE SIZE SERVING BOWL: This elegant hardwood serving bowl measures 11.5\" Diameter x 6\" Tall and holds up to 144 Ounces. Not just for salads, this bowl is versatile enough for preparing and serving just about any dish. Ideal for both hot and cold dishes, you can serve salads, soups, pasta, entrees, popcorn, and other snacks. You can also mix dough or use for food preparation. The large size bowl is a definite must-have for your kitchen EASY CARE AND HANDLING: You would think that cleaning a wooden kitchen bowl and servers can be difficult because of the material, but that is not the case with our Hardwood Salad Bowl. Easily clean by hand and it will last a lifetime. After washing, wipe them with a cloth and dry immediately. From time to time, you may apply mineral oil (not olive or vegetable oil) to keep the lustrous and elegant appearance A PERFECT GIFT FOR ANY OCCASION: A brilliant blend of traditional and contemporary this hardwood serving set's dark, undertone finish goes well with other tableware creating a decorative, yet unique table spread. The natural element of hardwood adds warm and welcoming feel to gatherings. A great gift to give your host for housewarmings or for weddings and anniversaries. Your mother, grandmother, wife, aunt, and sister will appreciate receiving a set for Mother's Day, Christmas, or birthdays MADE TO LAST: The pleasures of beautiful workmanship show in our large wooden salad bowl and serving set. Crafted for daily use, this set was designed to withstand any normal wear and tear. Do not put in dishwasher, microwave, freezer, or oven. To maintain the look and sheen, keep away from heat and sunlight. Durable, functional, and stylish, enjoy a lifetime of use with this set","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OimBn0CRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOLDN’ STORAGE","source_asin":"B09G8LBH7H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411932","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G8LBH7H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G8LBH7H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
