window.products.push({"id":411935,"name":"INSE Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 26Kpa 350W Stick Vacuum for Hardwood Floor, Up to 50 Mins Rechargeable Battery, 6-in-1 Household Wireless Lightweight Va","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TqoL1YI6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Powerful Suction & 3 Suction Modes Vacuum】With an absolute dominant 350W/140AW high-power brushless motor, wireless vacuum cleaner generates a high-speed airflow of up to 26KPA, that's enough to suck up to 6 Ibs item. This INSE S10 carries 3 power modes which is an ideal solution for all your daily cleaning needs, making it easy to pick up vacuum cleaner pet hair, debris from hardwood floors, low/mid pile carpet, rugs, stair, ceilings, sofas, bed, desk, cars, windowsills, curtain, and kitchen 【50 Mins Runtime Detachable Battery & 2 Charging Ways】Up to 50 mins runtime on the standard mode of cordless vacuum (15 mins on Deep Mode & 30 mins on Comfortable Mode), INSE S10 vacuum cleaner is perfect for uninterrupted whole-house cleaning- do not have to recharge during the cleaning. The detachable battery design of cordless stick vacuum cleaner allows the flexible choice of charging, can be charged singly or on the vacuums' main body, saving space and time 【Enhanced 6-Stage Filtration Technology】A 6-stage filtration system helps you enjoy fresh air during the cleaning operation(friendly to families with pets or the elderly), 80% reduction in suction loss, the whole filtration performance is 2x that of the normal filter. The 12 conical structures' centrifugal force of the high-speed rotation can suck things up apace and is used to further separate the extremely fine dust with an overall filtration rate of up to 99.97%. 【Easy to Use & Convenience Memory Function】INSE S10 cordless stick vacuum is the perfect cleaning companion that is equipped with a memory function, every time the electric stick vacuum is turned on, it starts at the speed setting last time automatically, and no need for any setting in advance. Key the trigger to begin quick cleaning or switch to automatic mode for pressing then releasing, suitable for whole house cleaning without holding the trigger 【Multifunctional & Lightweight Vacuum】It’s lightweight and portable the main motor is only 3 pounds about 1 bottle of 1000ml water so you can take it anywhere or go & down stairs. With versatile attachments(Freebie LED long crevice), the household vacuum cleaners can easily detach from a handheld vacuum. It can be applied to different scenarios such as furniture, ceiling, stair, or car, which solves the troubles of traditional vacuum cleaners that are inconvenient to clean hard-to-reach corners 【1.2L Dust Bin with Mess-free Emptying】1.2L large capacity can contain plenty of dust which can reduce the frequency of emptying the dustbin. INSE S10 wireless vacuum’s dust bin uses not easy-to-crack integrated material and it is thicker and lasts longer than a regular vacuum. No need to touch the dirt, just press the release button 【LED Motorized Cleaning Head & Wall-Hanging Compact Storage】150°Wide angle left and right and 90°vertical angle head brush reach into tight spaces with ease. With LED light, the stick vacuum cleaner can illuminate the surfaces ahead, allowing you to see dark corners and clean all dust from the invisible corner such as the area under the bed or sofa. The wall mount makes charging and storage easy and the adjustment extension rod can save your space","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TqoL1YI6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0C6DC8L7L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6DC8L7L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6DC8L7L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":411936,"name":"Windy Hill Collection 16\" x 16\" Vintage Decorative Wall Clock Union Hotel Paris France White Face Black Rim WC9-EA6063","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yR6Qk41VL._AC_.jpg","description":"Nice big clock! This is a classic, antique, traditional, and stylish black clock with cream background wall clock from Windy Hill Collection. The words Paris, France Union Hotel 159 Rue Du Bac are printed in black against a cream background. The metal 15-inch diameter frame has a vintage solid metal case with black rivets protruding from the bronze/black finish, and is a full 3.5 inches in height from the wall. Black colored words against a cream colored background with clear 3, 6, 9, 12 and large minute markings, plus large black teardrop hands make it crystal clear to read, even from a long distance. And there’s a single round hanger attached to the metal frame on the back for incredibly easy set-up and a lifetime of stability. The clock requires one AA battery, sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yR6Qk41VL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Windy Hill Collection","source_asin":"B07SB2R66T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SB2R66T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SB2R66T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
