window.products.push({"id":411960,"name":"CHAOWEI Digital LCD Dual Projection Alarm Clock Sound Clapping Controlled CW8097 Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VrUqLwcnL._AC_.jpg","description":"CHAOWEI's projection clock is distinguished by its fashionable outlook design and functionalities. Simply with a clap or a tap around the clock, LCD backlight as well as time projection would be activated and such function can be disabled by a dedicated button at the back. No more struggling to see the time when you wake up. With CHAOWEI's Projection Clock , you can see what time it is as soon as you open your eyes. The projector on this alarm clock allows you to display the time on your ceiling or wall, so the time will always be in full view when you need it. The swiveling projector can be tilted a full 150 degrees, enabling you to project the time virtually anywhere. The adjustable focus knob allows the time to be projected clearly for easy viewing, and projection can be turned on and off as desired. When the projection is turned off, you can easily view the time on the LED display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VrUqLwcnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chaowei","source_asin":"B005FEF8ZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-411960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005FEF8ZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005FEF8ZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
